

# Terraform Provider for Azure Landing Zones

Terraform provider for deploying and managing Azure Landing Zones (ALZ) using the Azure Verified Modules approach.

https://img.shields.io/badge/Go-1.23-blue.svg](https://golang.org)
https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MPL--2.0-brightgreen.svg](LICENSE)
https://img.shields.io/badge/Terraform-Registry-623CE4.svg](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/Azure/alz/latest)

## Overview

This provider enables you to deploy Azure Landing Zones with Terraform, following Microsoft's Cloud Adoption Framework.

It supports:

- Management Group hierarchy for ALZ
- Policy assignments and initiatives
- Role assignments
- Subscription placement and management

## Requirements

- Terraform >= 1.0
- Go >= 1.23 (for development only)
- Azure Subscription with Contributor access

## Quick Start

terraform {
  required_providers {
    alz = {
      source  = "Azure/alz"
      version = "~> 0.18"
    }
  }
}

provider "alz" {
  library_overrides = []
}

## Usage

See the examples directory for complete working examples.

### Basic Management Groups

resource "alz_management_group" "root" {
  display_name = "Root"
  parent_id    = "/providers/Microsoft.Management/managementGroups/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
  name         = "root"
}

